#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2467
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"1 long epic round — igloo needs 20 pieces, all enemies from the start, "
msgstr "1長篇史詩回合——伊格盧需要20塊,所有敵人從一開始,"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1895
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "10 sections of increasing difficulty. Destroy bridges to advance. "
msgstr "10節越來越困難。 摧毀橋樑推進。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1713
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"2-minute rounds, best of 3. Modes: Classic (open field) and Maze Battle. "
msgstr "2分鐘的回合,最好3次. 模式:經典(開放場)和Maze Battle."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1830
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"3 shared lives, 50 neon blocks (5 rows), ball speeds up. Arrow keys or A/D "
"to move."
msgstr "3條共享生命,50條霓虹板(5行),球速度加快. 要移動的箭頭鍵或 A/D 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2226
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "3-minute race in permanent darkness with fog bursts. "
msgstr "在永久黑暗和陣陣濃霧中進行的 3 分鐘比賽。 "

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3032
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "32 deathmatch-focused arena maps for the DOOM engine. BSD license."
msgstr "爲DOOM引擎繪製的32個死賽焦點競技場圖. BSD許可證."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1943
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "5 sections of intense River Raid action — river starts narrow, "
msgstr "5段猛烈的河襲行動——河流開始狹窄,"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2170
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "5 waves of pure chaos from the start. "
msgstr "五波清淨亂從始."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1350
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "7 days"
msgstr "7天時間"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2253
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "90 seconds to score maximum overtakes. "
msgstr "90秒得分最高超標."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3119
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A Viking-themed DOOM total conversion with hand-drawn pixel art — axes, "
"bows, and runic magic. Cacoward 2018 winner."
msgstr "一個維京主題的DOOM 完全轉換 手繪像素藝術——斧頭,弓,和狂野的魔法. 卡科沃德2018年獲獎者."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3003
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A complete free replacement for DOOM II — 32 levels with the Super Shotgun. "
"Compatible with community PWAD mods."
msgstr "完全免費替換DOOM II——32級與超級獵槍. 與社區PWAD Mods兼容."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3174
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A complete free replacement for Quake — original levels, art, and music "
"under BSD license."
msgstr "在BSD許可下完全免費替換Quake——原始關卡,藝術,和音樂."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2973
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A complete free replacement for Ultimate DOOM — 4 episodes, 36 levels with "
"original art and music."
msgstr "完全免費替換Ultimate DOOM——4集,36級配原創藝術和音樂."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3088
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A cyberpunk DOOM total conversion with new weapons, enemies, and levels. "
"Standalone v1.2 IWAD."
msgstr "網絡PUNK DOOM完全轉換 與新武器,敵人,和水平。 獨立 v1.2 IWAD."

