"Register and manage channels with ChanServ, including access lists and "
"channel settings."
msgstr "與 ChanServ 註冊和管理頻道,包括訪問列表和頻道設置."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/services.ex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
