"Register and protect your nickname with NickServ to prevent others from "
"using it."
msgstr "與NickServ註冊並保護您的暱稱,以防止他人使用."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1357
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
