"Registered nicknames expire after 7 days of inactivity and become available "
"again."
msgstr "已註冊的暱稱在7天無活動後到期,再次可用."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/commands.ex:442
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
