#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1074
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Join a channel-scoped audio/video conference with pre-join device preview, "
"layout controls, participant moderation, and live statistics. Conference "
"moderation follows channel permissions: half-operators and above can "
"moderate lower-ranked participants."
msgstr ""
"加入頻道掃描音頻/video會議,並預覽預覽預覽設備,佈局控制,參與者節制,以及現場統計. "
"會議節奏遵循頻道權限:半操作人員及以上人員可以溫和排名較低的參與者."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1142
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "P2P Sessions in Chat"
msgstr "P2P 聊天會話"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:78
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The chat, the solo arcade and this Help viewer share the same window "
"manager. The Help viewer is laid out like the classic Windows Help: a "
"toolbar (Back / Forward / Home), a navigator with Contents, Index and Search"
" tabs, and a \"See Also\" list of related topics under each article."
msgstr ""
"聊天,獨唱街機和這個幫助瀏覽器共用同一個窗口管理器. 幫助查看器的設置類似於經典的Windows Help:一個工具欄(Back / Forward /"
" Home),一個帶有內容,索引和搜索標籤的導航器,以及每個文章下的相關話題列表\"See also\"."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2665
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The game library opens as a draggable, maximizable window right on the chat "
"desktop — no separate page. Launching a game opens it in a new browser "
"window so it gets full keyboard focus."
msgstr "遊戲庫在聊天桌面上作爲可拖動,可最大化的窗口打開——沒有單獨的頁面. 推出遊戲在新瀏覽器窗口中打開,從而獲得全鍵盤焦點."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3488
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"When you enter a Space, a character picker appears first: choose from the "
"classic Hero or one of seven classes — Sorceress, Knight, Archer, Barbarian,"
" Rogue, Cleric or Monk. Each shows an animated preview and has its own "
"walking and attack animations; click one to enter the map wearing it, and "
"everyone in the space sees your choice. The picker shows again each time you"
" re-enter, defaulting to your last pick."
msgstr ""
"進入太空時,首先會出現一個挑角色者:從經典的英雄或七個班級中選擇一個——巫師,騎士,阿徹,野蠻人,羅格,教士或僧侶. "
"每個都顯示一個動畫預覽,並擁有自己的行走和攻擊動畫;點擊一鍵輸入所戴的地圖,空間中的每個人都看到你的選擇. "
"拾取者每次重新進入時都會再次顯示,默認爲最後的拾取."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2660
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"gameplay tips before launching. Open the Games menu and choose Arcade to "
"start (you must be registered and identified). "
msgstr "發射前的遊戲播放提示 。 打開 Games 菜單並選擇Arcade 開始( 您必須註冊和識別 ) 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3484
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "pick character"
msgstr "選擇字符"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1109
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Monitor call quality with real-time quality indicators. See also: Network "
"Statistics."
msgstr "監控呼叫質量與實時質量指標. 另見:網絡統計。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3462
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A multiplayer 8-bit virtual space built into every channel: people in the "
"channel can switch from Chat to Space, walk around the shared map, and keep "
"using the same channel conversation. Move with the Arrow keys, WASD or the "
"on-screen pad in the bottom-right corner — tap for a single step or hold to "
"walk continuously; Space or the pad's sword button swings your weapon. The "
"translucent button in the top-right corner switches the space to fullscreen "
"and back."
msgstr ""
"每個頻道中都包含一個多人8位虛擬空間:頻道中的人可以從Chat切換到Space,繞行共享的地圖,並不斷使用相同的頻道對話. 使用方向鍵、WASD "
"或右下角的螢幕方向板移動——輕按走一步，按住可連續行走；空白鍵或方向板上的劍按鈕揮舞武器。 右上角的半透明按鈕可將空間切換為全螢幕並返回。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2672
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Every game is also listed directly in the Games menu — pick one to jump "
"straight to its detail screen."
msgstr "每個遊戲也會直接列在「遊戲」選單中——選擇一個即可直接進入其詳細畫面。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1386
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Audit Log"
msgstr "行政審計日誌"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1443
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Broadcast"
msgstr "行政廣播"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1485
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Channels"
msgstr "管理頻道"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1465
