msgstr "管理危險區"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1405
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin MOTD"
msgstr "管理部"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1364
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Server Settings"
msgstr "管理員服務器設置"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1427
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin TURN"
msgstr "管理員 TURN"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1514
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin Users"
msgstr "管理員用戶"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3512
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Characters in a Space can spar with each other: press Space (or the pad's "
"sword button) next to another standing character to land a hit. Each hit "
"deals damage and shows a small health bar under their name; at zero HP the "
"character is knocked down for a few seconds, then gets back up on their own "
"with full health. Sitting characters are out of combat, and a knockout never"
" has any lasting effect — it is all in good fun."
msgstr ""
"空格中的字符可以相互切換:按空格(或墊的劍按鈕)在另一個站立字符旁邊,以降落一個命中. "
"每一次命中都會造成破壞,並用他們的名字顯示一個小健康酒吧;在0HP時,角色被打倒幾秒鐘,然後自己恢復健康。 "
"坐角色已經退出戰鬥,擊倒決決決不會產生任何持久的效果——這都很好玩."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1378
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Edit the server's name, description, welcome message, channel limit and "
"registration policy."
msgstr "編輯服務器的名稱,描述,歡迎消息,頻道限制和註冊政策."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1501
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Inspect, create, delete and purge channels, and administer their ChanServ "
