#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Arcade links can render as rich cards with Join/Open actions while they are "
"live. P2P requests use the PM header for Start/Join/Decline and keep "
"transcript rows as inert history showing request, connected and ended "
"states."
msgstr ""
"街機鏈接在直播時可以使用 join/Open 動作作爲豐富的卡片渲染. "
"P2P請求使用PM頭用於Start/Join/Decline,並保留記錄行作爲惰性歷史顯示請求,連接和結束狀態."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:330
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Configure the commands that run automatically when you connect."
msgstr "配置連接時自動運行的命令 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/commands.ex:338
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Invite someone to a P2P session that runs an audio/video call, file "
"transfers, and games together over one connection. The request arrives in "
"the private message and the PM header shows Join/Decline — accepting it "
"starts the session right there, with the P2P Session Console opening on the "
"chat desktop. See also: P2P Sessions in Chat, P2P Session."
msgstr ""
"請某人蔘加一個P2P會話,通過一個連接運行一個音頻/video呼叫,文件傳輸,和遊戲. 請求在私人信件中到達,PM頭顯示爲 "
"join/Decline——接受它從那裏開始會話,在聊天桌面上打開P2P會話控制檯. 另見: Chat中的P2P會話,P2P會話."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1048
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Make video calls with camera controls, picture-in-picture, and quality "
"settings. See also: P2P Session."
msgstr "以相機控制、圖片畫面、質量設置製作視頻。 另見:P2P會話."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1116
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "P2P Session"
msgstr "P2P會議"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1161
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Run a P2P session without leaving the chat: /p2p <nick> opens setup, shows "
"the creator's P2P Session Console immediately, and sends a request line into"
" the private message. The invited person's PM tab opens in the background "
"with Join/Decline in the PM header. Once connected, the P2P menu (also "
"mirrored in the Start menu) opens the P2P Session Console on the chat "
"desktop with Call, Files, Games and Stats sections. The conversation IS the "
"private message — session events (connected, file received, game results, "
"who ended it) are saved into the PM history as P2P lines, and the PM tab "
"shows a small P2P icon while the session is live. The status bar always "
"shows the active session: click it to bring the P2P Session Console to the "
"front, or use its stop button to cancel a pending invite / end the session. "
"You can hold ONE session at a time — accepting a new invite (or inviting "
"someone else) asks to end the current session first. When a TURN relay is "
"configured, Toggle Privacy Mode in the P2P menu forces the connection "
"through the relay so your IP address is never shared with the peer. See "
"also: P2P Session, Video Call, File Transfer, Private Messages."
msgstr ""
"在不離開聊天的情況下運行一個 P2P 會話: /p2p <nick> 打開設置,立即顯示創建者的 P2P 會話控制檯,並將請求行發送到私人信件中. "
"受邀人士的PM標籤在背景中打開,在PM頭部有JUIN/Decline. "
"連接後,P2P菜單(亦在Start菜單中反射)在聊天桌面上打開了P2P會話控制檯,包含Call,File,Games和Stats等部分. "
"對話是私人消息——會話事件(連接,收到文件,遊戲結果,誰結束)被保存到PM歷史中作爲P2P線條,PM標籤在會話直播時會顯示一個小的P2P圖標. "
"狀態欄總是顯示活動會話:單擊它將 P2P 會話控制檯帶到前面,或者使用它的停止按鈕取消待決邀請/結束會話. "
"你可以一次舉行一屆會議——接受新的邀請(或邀請他人)要求先結束本屆會議。 當配置了 TURN 中繼器時, 在 P2P "
"菜單中切換隱私模式會通過中繼器強制連接, 所以您的 IP 地址永遠不會與端點共享 。 ưμ㼯A"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1246
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Send files directly to other users via peer-to-peer with drag-and-drop "
"support. See also: P2P Session."
msgstr "在拖放支持下,通過對等程序直接向其他用戶發送文件. 另見:P2P會話."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:585
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Session Cards and P2P History"
msgstr "會話卡和P2P歷史"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1131
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The P2P Session is the persistent peer-to-peer connection behind /p2p — one "
"link that hosts a call, file transfers and games all at the same time. It "
"lives inside the chat: accepting an invite opens the P2P Session Console "
"right on the chat desktop, and ending any one activity never drops the "
"others. See also: P2P Sessions in Chat."
msgstr ""
"P2P會話是/p2p背後持續的對等連接——一個同時託管一個呼叫,文件傳輸和遊戲的鏈接. "
"它住在聊天內部:接受邀請後,在聊天桌面上右側打開P2P會話控制檯,結束任何一項活動都不會放棄其他活動. 另見:聊天中的P2P會話."

