#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:70
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The chat runs on a Windows-style desktop: the chat itself is one pinned "
"window (maximized by default) that you can restore, drag and resize, over a "
"taskbar with a Start menu and a tray clock. Window layout persists across "
"visits. The window, its taskbar button and the browser tab are all named "
"after the conversation you are in. "
msgstr ""
"聊天在一個Windows風格的桌面上運行:聊天本身是一個被綁定的窗口(默認爲最大),您可以恢復,拖曳和調整大小,通過一個帶有Start菜單和托盤時鐘的任務欄."
" 各個訪問的窗口布局持續存在。 視窗、工作列按鈕和瀏覽器分頁都以你目前所在的對話命名。 "

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:919
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Bar showing your live session: active call or P2P session, online buddies, "
"lag indicator, clock, and mute state. Who you are and what you are reading "
"are named in the chat window's title bar."
msgstr ""
"顯示目前工作階段狀態的列：進行中的通話或 P2P 工作階段、線上好友、延遲指示、時鐘和靜音狀態。你是誰、正在看哪個對話，顯示在聊天視窗的標題列。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:823
