msgstr "訊息格式"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:92
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"On a phone the desktop stacks: one window fills the screen at a time and the"
" taskbar switches between them — the same strip of window buttons as on a "
"desktop, squeezed to fit and scrolled when crowded. The conversations and "
"user list keep no column of their own there: the first two buttons of the "
"conversation toolbar slide each one open over the chat, so every message and"
" the message box run the full width of the screen. The Start menu opens one "
"level at a time: tapping a group replaces the list with its entries, and the"
" group's own row at the top takes you back."
msgstr ""
"在電話上,桌面堆棧:一個窗口一次填充屏幕,任務欄在它們之間開關——與桌面上相同的條形窗口按鈕,擠壓以適應擁擠時滾動. "
"會話列表和使用者列表不再佔用自己的一欄：會話工具列最左邊的兩個按鈕會把它們疊加在聊天之上開啟，因此每則訊息和訊息輸入框都能佔滿整個螢幕寬度。 "
"\"開始\"菜單一次打開一個關卡:點擊一個組用其條目替換列表,該組自己在頂部的行將你帶回."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:104
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The menu bar becomes a rail of icons across the top of the screen — one per "
"menu, in the same order as on the desktop. Tapping one opens the menu "
"already on that section; tapping another switches to it, and tapping the one"
" already open closes the menu."
msgstr "菜單欄成爲橫跨屏幕頂部的圖標欄——每個菜單一個,順序與桌面相同. 打開一個菜單 打開另一個開關 打開一個就關閉菜單"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:183
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "attachments"
msgstr "附件"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:186
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "download"
msgstr "下載"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:184
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "files"
msgstr "檔案"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:187
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "signed URL"
msgstr "簽署 URL"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:185
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "upload"
msgstr "上傳"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:145
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Entries you cannot use right now are grayed out rather than hidden. Opening "
"Start ▸ Tools from the landing page shows Address Book, Notify List and the "
"rest in gray: they are real parts of the app, waiting for you to connect. "
"The menu is the same map wherever you are standing on it."
msgstr ""
"你現在不能使用的條目是灰色的而不是隱藏的。 從登陸頁面打開 Start QQ "
"工具顯示地址簿,通知列表和其餘的灰色:它們是應用程序的真實部分,等待您連接. 菜單是相同的地圖 無論你站在它上。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:155
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Link Previews"
msgstr "鏈接預覽"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:167
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"On a desktop a group flies out beside the menu and hovering another group "
"switches to it. On a phone the menu drills down instead: tapping a group "
"replaces the list with its entries and the group's own row at the top takes "
"you back."
msgstr ""
"在一個桌面上,一組飛出菜單旁邊,徘徊着另一組開關。 在電話上,菜單會向下跳動:點擊一個組用它的條目來替換列表,該組自己在頂部的行會帶你回來."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:442
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "System Windows"
msgstr "系統窗口"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:115
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Start Menu"
msgstr "啓動菜單"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:138
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The Start button opens the same menu on every screen RetroHexChat has — the "
"landing pages, the Connect screen, the chat, this Help viewer and the design"
" system. What changes between them is which entries are live."
msgstr ""
"\"開始\"按鈕在RetroHexChat的每個屏幕上打開相同的菜單——登陸頁,連接屏幕,聊天,這個幫助查看器和設計系統. "
"他們之間的變化是哪些條目是直播的."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:147
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"View and manage URLs shared across all channels with standards-based link "
"previews."
msgstr "查看和管理所有頻道共享的帶有鏈接預覽的 URL 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:495
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Every window that shows rows shares one table: resize its columns, choose "
"which ones show, order by any of them, and copy what you select."
msgstr "每個顯示行的窗口共享一個表格:調整其列的大小,選擇哪個列顯示,由其中任何一個顯示順序,並複製您選擇的內容。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:477
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Listings & Tables"
msgstr "列表與表格"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:469
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Thirteen admin-only windows that read the running server: its memory, "
"processes, connections, database, Oban jobs and live metrics."
msgstr "13個只讀取運行中的服務器的管理員窗口:它的內存,進程,連接,數據庫,Oban任務和活度量."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:489
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "column"
msgstr "欄"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:490
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "resize"
msgstr "調整大小"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:491
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "sort"
msgstr "排序"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:488
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "table"
msgstr "圖表"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Connect Window"
msgstr "連接窗口"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/bots.ex:158
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Monitor RSS/Atom feeds and post new items to channels as rich Markdown link "
"previews, reusing pages the server has already read."
msgstr "監視 RSS/Atom 種子,並將新項目作爲豐富的Markdown 鏈接預覽發佈到頻道,重新使用服務器已經讀過的頁面."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:37
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Sign in from the Connect window, which appears both on its own screen and on"
" every public page. It carries the whole flow: pick a nickname, register a "
"new one or enter a password for a registered one, and choose whether to "
"remember the terminal. A remembered terminal signs you in with a single "
"click, and one set to auto-login takes you straight to the chat."
msgstr ""
"從 Connect 窗口簽名,它既出現在自己的屏幕上,也出現在每一個公開頁面上. "
"它攜帶整個流:選擇一個暱稱,註冊一個新的或輸入註冊的密碼,並選擇是否記得終端. 一個記得的終端標誌 用一擊, 一個集自動登錄 帶你直接聊天。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:172
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A link pasted in a conversation gets a card under the message — source, "
"headline, byline, image and summary — the same card an RSS bot publishes. "
"The page is read once and kept, so the same link posted again is never "
"fetched twice."
msgstr ""
"在談話中粘貼的鏈接在消息下獲得一張卡片——來源,頭條,旁線,圖像和摘要——RSS bot出版的同一張卡片. "
"頁面被讀取一次並保存,因此再次發佈的同一鏈接再也沒有兩次被獲取."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:577
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Clickable nicknames, channels, and URLs, with hover cards and a preview card"
" under any message carrying a link."
msgstr "可點擊的暱稱,頻道,和URL,在任何信件下都有懸浮卡和預覽卡,帶有鏈接."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics.ex:61
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics.ex:91
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1580
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1581
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Retro Games"
msgstr "復古遊戲"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1583
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "retro games"
msgstr "復古遊戲"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1637
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Play browser-native RetroHexChat games solo against AI inside the chat "
"desktop. Hex Pong, Light Trails, Star Duel variants, Block Breakers, Hex "
"Warlords, Hex Raid variants, Hex Outlaw variants, Hex Tennis variants, Hex "
