#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:153
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The entries are grouped one level deep, and the menu carries everything the "
"app can do: anything a menu bar offers is offered here too. View acts on the"
" window in front of you; Tools holds the address book, lists, channel "
"windows and the display settings; Automation holds Perform, Auto-Join, "
"aliases, custom menus and timers; P2P comes alive with a peer session; Games"
" holds Retro Games and the Arcade; Account and Admin hold their own; Windows"
" reopens a window of the screen you are on; Navigate reaches the public "
"pages, the documentation and the app; Language switches locale; Help holds "
"the topics, the cheatsheet and About. Disconnect sits alone at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"項目只分一層群組，而這個功能表收錄了應用程式能做的一切：功能表列提供的，這裡同樣提供。「檢視」作用於你面前的視窗；「工具」收納通訊錄、各種清單、頻道視窗和顯示設定；「自動化」收納"
" Perform、Auto-"
"Join、別名、自訂功能表和計時器；「P2P」在有對等工作階段時才活起來；「遊戲」收納復古遊戲和大型電玩；「帳戶」和「管理」各自收納自己的；「視窗」重新開啟目前畫面的視窗；「導覽」通往公開頁面、文件和應用程式；「語言」切換語言；「說明」收納主題、速查表和關於。「中斷連線」單獨放在最下面。"
